  "collectionNotes": [
    "真实SPI无MCU CS接法；ST7796参考MADCTL48的独立红绿像素，错误MOSI不写。",
    "FT6336通用坐标报告子集、TCA EX1共享复位、EX6高有效PWR输入、原生SD1bit路由，未沿用M5身份寄存器。",
    "原厂S3镜像布局/checksum和完整ROM负面运行记录；529零件原厂STEP与独立-C工程外壳尺寸。",
    "Exact storefront SKU registration with the stated digital subsets. Partial does not mean whole-device or physical acceptance.",
    "精确SKU包内电池、外壳、排针和天线差异保持独立身份；共用数字路径不表示机械与RF等价。",
    "UIFlow/小智是固定Git板树的范围化调查，生成检查收据不冒称HTTP响应：{\"uiflow\": \"固定提交a61a29409f09f1f4bebae05e15c4bd6dcc4956b6板树中无Waveshare命名目录；此检索范围不证明不存在第三方移植。\", \"xiaozhi\": \"固定提交92d400d6374bbe750e0a0188fa969fc4042820c2板树已检索；未建立此精确SKU的可直接运行镜像。\"}",
    "模型来源和几何范围：waveshare-esp32-s3-touch-lcd-3-5-c；model-plan.json保留原始参考、尺寸、图像像素/UV及UNKNOWN边界。",
    "模型逐项边界：Native source CAD is retained without scale changes, including free shells and faces. Simplified materials and approximate screen registration do not establish hardware revision, connector mating or physical pixel calibration.；SKU30934 includes OV5640. Verified installed camera/FPC/bracket CAD and exact case button/connector pockets are unavailable; geometry remains UNKNOWN. Case controls remain usable in the public2D controls, without invented3D hit surfaces.；Native electrical assembly source is a manufacturer reference; current20261021 firmware explicitly targets S3 chip9 and this3.5/ST7796 board. 3.5B/AXS15231B is a separate hardware family.；Front corner radius7.30mm and0.60mm lip are dimensioned exterior features; internal side-wall/rear-cap1mm and body corner shape remain estimates, not manufacturer CAD."
